## Project-Specific Testing Rules

Add or update tests when changing validation, RBAC, services, migrations, or critical dashboard behavior.

### Required test/check coverage

| Area | What to test/check |
|------|-------------------|
| Admin routes | Every `admin.*` route has a corresponding permission string in `lang/*/admin/routes.php` |
| Translation keys | No missing keys for labels rendered in admin views (scan `__('admin/...')` calls against `lang/*/admin/` files) |
| Boolean/toggle edit state | Select/checkbox renders the existing model value correctly (not just default state) |
| Seeder compatibility | All non-nullable columns without defaults are provided; translations follow parent-first + batch pattern |
| N+1 prevention | Important index/show pages eager-load all displayed relations (add a test that asserts no lazy loading if feasible) |

If tests cannot be added, document manual verification steps in the PR or commit message.